# alfanhui/circuit-breaker#6: centred start, boundary toggle, debug camera Z limits.
# The BIOS intro and Sega licence screen take ~13 s; the game starts moving straight away
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
skip_prologue # straight to play, the cycle at its start
# Debug camera Z: a crash only stops the cycle (this crashes on purpose, to look at what's left)
press start
press z
press start
# The game starts in 1st person; these steps were written from iso, so switch to it first
press down
wait 0.3
shot 01_start
# Cruise north (-y) from the centre: the boundary stops it at y -896
wait 4
shot 02_stopped_at_edge
# Y: boundary off, the cycle carries on through the wall
press y
wait 1
shot 03_unbounded
# Y again: snaps back to the edge
press y
wait 0.5
shot 04_rebounded
# Paused (the debug camera): B held with up climbs until the ceiling (view z -4000), with down
# drops to the floor (view z 0). (L and R were the height before they were the pause menu's)
press start
keydown b
hold up 15
shot 05_ceiling
hold down 18
keyup b
shot 06_floor
